{
  "name": "obj3_step6b",
  "description": "Objective 3, Step 6 re-run of the dev dialogues after the router fix (openings such as 'Can you help me pick a watch?' and 'Watch lene aaya hoon' now route to shopping): O3-S5h (baseline) and O3-S6 (template questions), both models, Vulkan. About 1.5 hours; resumable.",
  "runs": [
